DOS'S
Think before posting — consider how it may affect your reputation
Use strong privacy settings to control who sees your content
Verify information before sharing to avoid spreading misinformation
Be respectful and professional in comments and interactions
Use strong, unique passwords to protect your accounts

DONT'S
Don’t overshare personal information (address, phone number, location)
Don’t engage in cyberbullying or trolling
Don’t click on suspicious links or messages
Don’t post offensive or inappropriate content
Don’t use public Wi-Fi for sensitive activities without security
